<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE V ENGLAND FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE V ENGLAND FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the opening day of</p>
<p>the first test between Zimbabwe and England at Queen's Club on</p>
<p>Wednesday:</p>
<p>Zimbabwe first innings</p>
<p> G.Flower c Hussain b Silverwood	   43</p>
<p> S.Carlisle c Crawley b Gough		 0</p>
<p> A.Campbell c Silverwood b Croft	   84</p>
<p> D.Houghton c Stewart b Croft		34</p>
<p> A.Flower not out				58</p>
<p> A.Waller c Crawley b Croft		  15</p>
<p> G.Whittall c Atherton b Silverwood	 7</p>
<p> P.Strang not out				 0</p>
<p> Extras (lb-2 w-2 nb-11)		     15</p>
<p> Total (for six wickets)		    256</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-3 2-130 3-136 4-206 5-235 6-252</p>
<p>To bat: H.Streak, B.Strang, H.Olonga</p>
<p>Bowling: Mullally 14-3-43-0 (nb1 w1), Gough 21-4-70-1 (nb5</p>
<p>w1), Silverwood 13-4-50-2 (nb4), Croft 29-12-45-3, Tufnell</p>
<p>15-2-46-0 (nb1)</p>
<p>England - Mike Atherton (captain), Nick Knight, Alec</p>
<p>Stewart, Graham Thorpe, Nasser Hussain, John Crawley, Robert</p>
